# Firefox extension build artifacts
*.xpi
# ...except the stable-named AMO-signed xpi. The NixOS force-install policy
# (nixos-config/hosts/common/default.nix) references it by path, so it must
# exist on disk on every machine; tracking it means a plain `git pull`
# provisions a new laptop instead of a fresh AMO re-sign. Same reason the
# voice-assistant repo tracks orchestrator-bridge.xpi.
!contextforge-bridge-signed.xpi
web-ext-artifacts/
tools/contextforge-extension/.amo-upload-uuid
